    <!-- Rescan games' value: how many games (%1$s, "12 games") and manuals (%2$s, "3 manuals") were found. -->
    <string name="settings_library_games_manuals">%1$s · %2$s</string>
    <string name="settings_library_rescan_help">Look through your game folders again, for games you just copied over, and for manuals. Tandem also checks by itself whenever you come back to it. Manuals and guides go in ROMs/manuals/&lt;system&gt;/ named like the game (Pokemon Red.pdf for Pokemon Red.gb): a PDF, a zip or folder of pictures, or a text or Markdown file. Read them from a game\'s Y menu and on the bottom screen while it plays, or pick one under Y › Edit details › Manual.</string>

