    <string name="settings_updates_auto_help">Look for a new Tandem once a day while Tandem is open, and say so once with a message and in the Start panel. It only asks GitHub for the latest version number; nothing installs until you press Update. Off, nothing is checked or shown until you check with A on Updates. Private mode skips it.</string>
